<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS3.SSS0.Px4" title="In 4.3 Ablations ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ SpatialAlign: Aligning Dynamic Spatial Relationships in Video Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Ablations on threshold <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{\text{train}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>train</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{\text{train}}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS3.SSS0.Px5" title="In 4.3 Ablations ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ SpatialAlign: Aligning Dynamic Spatial Relationships in Video Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Ablations on different prompt structure.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In SpatialAlign: Aligning Dynamic Spatial Relationships in Video Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5 </span>Conclusion</span></a>
