<p id="A1.I1.i26.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i26.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">On a courtyard deck showing lanterns, a squirrel is </span><span id="A1.I1.i26.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#00FFFF;">on the <math id="A1.I1.i26.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\overset{\uparrow}{\text{top}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#00FFFF;" mathcolor="#00FFFF">top</mtext><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#00FFFF;" mathcolor="#00FFFF" mathsize="0.700em" stretchy="false">↑</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\overset{\uparrow}{\text{top}}</annotation></semantics></math> of</span><span id="A1.I1.i26.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> a stone, then the squirrel darts </span><span id="A1.I1.i26.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#FF8000;">to the right<sup id="A1.I1.i26.p1.1.4.1" class="ltx_sup">→</sup> of</span><span id="A1.I1.i26.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> the stone.</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i27" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i27.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i27.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i27.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Near a hedgerow featuring sparrows, a cat is </span><span id="A1.I1.i27.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#00FFFF;">on the <math id="A1.I1.i27.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\overset{\uparrow}{\text{top}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#00FFFF;" mathcolor="#00FFFF">top</mtext><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#00FFFF;" mathcolor="#00FFFF" mathsize="0.700em" stretchy="false">↑</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\overset{\uparrow}{\text{top}}</annotation></semantics></math> of</span><span id="A1.I1.i27.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> a desk, then the cat sneaks </span><span id="A1.I1.i27.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#FF8000;">to the right<sup id="A1.I1.i27.p1.1.4.1" class="ltx_sup">→</sup> of</span><span id="A1.I1.i27.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> the desk.</span></p>
</div></li>
